sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente (Swagger /docs)
    participant R as api/routes/agent.py
    participant S as schemas/agent.py
    participant A as services/agent_service.py
    participant G as tools/registry.py
    participant P as providers/openrouter.py
    participant L as OpenRouter (LLM)
    participant V as tools/schemas.py (EffortArgs)
    participant F as tools/functions.py

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/agent/chat {question, max_steps...}
    R->>S: valida AgentChatRequest (422 si falla)
    R->>A: Depends(get_agent_service) -> ask(question, ...)
    A->>G: tool_definitions()
    G-->>A: catálogo (incluye estimate_learning_effort)
    A->>P: complete_with_tools(messages, tools)
    P->>L: HTTP POST /chat/completions + tools
    L-->>P: tool_call estimate_learning_effort {difficulty, topics, weekly_hours}
    P-->>A: mensaje con tool_calls
    A->>G: execute_tool(name, arguments, confirm_actions)
    G->>V: EffortArgs.model_validate(args)
    V-->>G: argumentos válidos (o invalid_arguments)
    G->>F: estimate_learning_effort(args)
    F-->>G: {total_hours, weeks, effort_level, explanation}
    G-->>A: {"ok": true, "data": {...}}
    A->>P: complete_with_tools(messages + role=tool)
    P->>L: HTTP POST con el resultado de la herramienta
    L-->>P: texto final
    P-->>A: content
    A-->>R: AgentResult(answer, tools_used)
    R-->>C: 200 {answer, model, tools_used}
